# ui-input.ot - copy text through a native button event

create window into app
title of app is "Otter Input"

create text box into input
text of input is "Type here"

create text box into output
text of output is "Your text appears here"

create button into copyButton
text of copyButton is "Copy text"

put input in app
put output in app
put copyButton in app

when copyButton is clicked
    text of output is text of input
.

show app
